Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: add configurable CDN asset helper

Large media moves out of the repo and onto Cloudflare R2 behind a custom
CDN domain. lib/cdn.ts resolves public asset paths against
NEXT_PUBLIC_CDN_BASE_URL, falling back to the local public/ path when the
variable is unset so a plain checkout still works.

Only public values live under NEXT_PUBLIC_*; R2 write credentials stay on
the backend.

